  arenax:['Hosts create private rooms and share a generated code or invite link.','The server owns the clock and accepts only the first valid answer for each player and question.','Players receive shuffled choices and can reconnect to a room snapshot.','Hosts can reuse, edit, reorder, archive, and restore question collections.','A simulation script exercises live matches with 50 connected players.'],
  triage:['A deterministic rules and classifier stage assigns a severity level to a report.','Hybrid text retrieval ranks similar issues and likely source files.','Commit diffs and ownership history are scored to suggest investigation leads.','The pipeline can draft a pytest reproduction and a Markdown report for review.','A synthetic mode demonstrates the workflow locally without claiming repository-specific findings.'],
  finance:['New accounts and session logins are handled through Spring Security.','Income and expense forms feed the same service and repository layer.','The dashboard combines balance, recent entries, budgets, and monthly totals.','Monthly category spending is compared against its configured cap.','Spring Data JPA maps the finance entities to the MySQL database.'],
  shortener:['Express routes keep API endpoints separate from request handling.','Mongoose connects persisted link records to MongoDB.','Helmet headers are configured at the app boundary.','API requests are rate limited to help control bursts.'],
  codealpha:['Add, list, and remove grades, then inspect averages and grade ranges.','A paper-trading simulation tracks sample prices, cash, and a portfolio.','The offline chatbot responds to a small set of common prompts and commands.','Create, list, and cancel sample bookings with date and cost validation.'],
  nexus:['Prepared PDO queries load posts together with author, vote, and comment counts.','Search can match post titles, body text, and author names.','Signed-in users can create posts, comment, vote, and share.','Theme preference and profile details are stored with the user account.','A user can switch the stored preference and edit profile information.'],
  clarify:['The dashboard computes net worth, monthly income vs expense, savings rate, and daily safe-to-spend on the server so the page loads with real numbers.','A 26-week heatmap maps daily outflow intensity, letting you spot high-spend streaks at a glance.','Each savings goal tracks a target amount, current progress, and an optional 72-hour wish vault that delays impulse purchases.','Recurring bills — rent, EMIs, subscriptions — are listed with due dates and upcoming amounts so nothing surprises you at month end.','CSV import parses bank statement exports and maps them to transaction categories; PDF export produces a formatted monthly report.'],
  contractguard:['OpenAPI specs are stored as versioned snapshots so every diff is against a known baseline rather than the previous deploy.','The proxy intercepts real traffic and compares each JSON response field-by-field — type mutations and missing required keys surface as categorised violations.','Redis backs the mock data layer so test runs are deterministic and reproducible without touching a real upstream.','The Python CLI exits non-zero on critical violations, making it straightforward to block a pull request in any CI pipeline.','The FastAPI service generates edge-case payloads — boundary values, null fields, type coercions — optionally using a local Ollama model or a cloud API.'],
